00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:43,500
Cow is a documentary film directed by Andrea Arnold.

2
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:21,000
A close-up portrait of the daily lives of a pair of cows: told by way of some narrative-free, intimate POV photography, with plenty of close shot images, we follow the
daily routine of these animals as they live what can only be described as mundane, boring lives - all with an ultimate purpose within the human food chain.

3
00:34:52,500 --> 00:34:58,500
Self - Audio Description (voice), played by Lin Gallagher.

4
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Holy Cow is a 2022 Indian Hindi-language satirical comedy
film written and directed by Sai Kabir.

5
00:58:07,500 --> 00:58:13,500
Starring Sanjay Mishra,Tigmanshu Dhulia, Sadiya Siddiqui and
Nawazuddin Siddiqui in a cameo appearance.

6
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:51,000
It released on 26 August 2022.

7
01:21:22,500 --> 01:21:28,500
The film explores themes of farm, dairy cow, animal
life, domestic animal, animal behaviour.
